  "content": "<p>此模組為遊戲增添了數個新實體。其中一些實體具有敵意，而其他則用於營造氛圍或作為環境的一部分。我們的目標是提供眾多新生物，為遊戲帶來全新且有趣的機制，同時保持原版遊戲的體驗感。</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/238/920/cursed-armor.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\"></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/238/921/info_pumpkin.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\"></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/238/922/will-o-wisp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\"></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/238/919/info_knight.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\"></p>\n\n<p><br><img src=\"https://skulk.blmj.red/eerie-entities\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"></p>",
